# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — never commit. The first entry is the one that actually matters:
# .license-key.pem is the Ed25519 PRIVATE key that mints every TokenBrake
# licence. If it ever lands in a repo, anyone who reads it can issue unlimited
# free licences forever and the whole paid product is void. There is no undo —
# git history keeps it even after deletion.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.license-key.pem
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Vercel
.vercel/
.vercel

# Local databases and ledgers (customer spend data — not ours to publish)
*.db
*.sqlite
.tokenbrake/
.tokenbrake-server.db
.tokenbrake-trial

# Build artefacts
node_modules/
*.tgz
mcp-package/*.tgz

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
